* ngspice init settings for the sky130 PDK model libraries.
*
* The sweep runner (bin/sweep.py) does not depend on this file directly --
* it sets the equivalent options via explicit netlist `.option` lines in
* every generated deck, so a run is reproducible independent of whatever
* happens to be in ~/.spiceinit on the machine that runs it. This file is
* kept in-repo for interactive/manual ngspice sessions against the same
* PDK, and to document the settings a record was produced under.
*
* Same settings as the sibling sky130-ldo / sky130-bandgap harnesses (same
* PDK, same pin): derived from the PDK's own libs.tech/ngspice/spinit.
*
*   cp sim/gm-id-characterization/spiceinit ./.spiceinit
*   ngspice -b sim/gm-id-characterization/testbench/nfet_gmid.spice.tmpl

set ngbehavior=hsa     ; HSPICE-ish compatibility, required to read PDK libs
set skywaterpdk        ; skip some checks for faster lib loading
set ng_nomodcheck      ; do not check model parameters
option noinit          ; do not dump operating point data into the log
option klu              ; KLU direct linear solver
